# Generated by `prisma generate`. Rebuilt by `pnpm setup`, and by CI before it
# typechecks, so there is no reason to track it.
#
# `payload-types.ts` and `admin/importMap.js` are generated too, but they are
# committed on purpose: Payload's own templates commit them, and a clone that
# has them typechecks and builds before anyone runs a generator.
